eougc/AF1QipNnBv6uXvTN-cw8QR7xHFxoz5ID4jz3B0Y7MG9F\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipNnBv6uXvTN-cw8QR7xHFxoz5ID4jz3B0Y7MG9F"]],"7657087930376309383","4807877109313218834",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003dbcbf4962a96dc40c\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E9%86%87%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E7%B8%BD%E5%BA%97\u0026ludocid\u003d1914959645423198281\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEPuFutimhILAqAE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEPuFutimhILAqAE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F4807877109313218834%2FlocalPosts%2F7657087930376309383/version/1780239736203000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCIeVi8D1nNyhahIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFUHVGdXRpbWhJTEFxQUUaE0Nnd0ktSnJ4MEFZUTRLdnlud0k\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E9%86%87%E4%B8%80%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E7%B8%BD%E5%BA%97\u0026ludocid\u003d1914959645423198281\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEPuFutimhILAqAE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5Uaf5D6BPJhMvwB3shn6p9t","0ahUKEwiNw4rtu9KWAxXpdvUHHYMLIhkQ544CCJoCKDc",null,"2026年5月31日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u4807877109313218834/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM3NjU3MDg3OTMwMzc2MzA5Mzgz","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u4807877109313218834/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM3NjU3MDg3OTMwMzc2MzA5Mzgz",null,null,null,null,null,["7657087930376309383","CIHM0ogKEPuFutimhILAqAE","CgwI-Jrx0AYQ4KvynwI"]],[null,[[["🦪燻旨牡蠣拉麵｜期間限定 NT.340\n\n春夏新品來囉\n-煙燻油封牡蠣x牡蠣魚介貝類金湯-\n\nI 以煙燻封存牡蠣的海味\n  嚴選牡蠣以昆布與清酒低溫熟成\n  再以日本山櫻花木屑細緻煙燻\n  隨後浸入義大利初榨橄欖\n  並點綴些許山椒提香\n\nI 牡蠣魚介貝類金湯\n  以魚介與蛤蜊熬製高湯\n  融合大量新鮮牡蠣打勻乳化\n  細緻過濾成就濃厚滑順的牡蠣湯底\n\n濃厚海味中帶著淡淡煙燻香氣,最後以山椒檸檬清香收尾，成就一碗濃厚而細膩的海味拉麵",1]]],[1774340666,1790151866],null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipObcSthrAxckxoEW6mKpl5cIgzZNuVbPxaEIllW\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipObcSthrAxckxoEW6mKpl5cIgzZNuVbPxaEIllW"]]