、金華火腿、干貝的精華，還特別溶入了鹹蛋黃，所以多了一層獨特的微沙沙口感與鹹香，感覺是比較偏向中式料理的湯頭。配置有炙燒過的生食級大干貝和雞腿肉叉燒，上方點綴微辣的明太子，以及半顆溏心蛋，好吃。蔬菜類只有青蔥和些許筍乾，所以我又加點一了一份和風野菜。麵條比較沒什麼印象。",null,[0,9]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4807877109313218834/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzWmxwSVFteFdWamxEWTBkNFdXVnVhRkJZTWxKTlVrWTVWMk5WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4807877109313218834/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzWmxwSVFteFdWamxEWTBkNFdXVnVhRkJZTWxKTlVrWTVWMk5WUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4807877109313218834/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzWmxwSVFteFdWamxEWTBkNFdXVnVhRkJZTWxKTlVrWTVWMk5WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4807877109313218834/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzWmxwSVFteFdWamxEWTBkNFdXVnVhRkJZTWxKTlVrWTVWMk5WUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4807877109313218834/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzWmxwSVFteFdWamxEWTBkNFdXVnVhRkJZTWxKTlVrWTVWMk5WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4807877109313218834/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzWmxwSVFteFdWamxEWTBkNFdXVnVhRkJZTWxKTlVrWTVWMk5WUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,3291,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sZlpIQmxWVjlDY0d4WWVuaFBYMlJNUkY5V2NVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1a934da6d0a86049!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmlfZHBlVV9CcGxYenhPX2RMRF9WcUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sZlpIQmxWVjlDY0d4WWVuaFBYMlJNUkY5V2NVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sZlpIQmxWVjlDY0d4WWVuaFBYMlJNUkY5V2NVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sZlpIQmxWVjlDY0d4WWVuaFBYMlJNUkY5V2NVRRILMGU2TVNkU1BJYnUaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tbGZaSEJsVlY5Q2NHeFllbmhQWDJSTVJGOVdjVUUSCzBlNk1TZFNQSWJ1IhIJAAAAAAAAAAA